-02#:~:text=It%20was%20the%20leather,hung%20from%20the%20chair","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=It%20was%20the%20leather,hung%20from%20the%20chair","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e6","era":null,"summary":"Halana and Alena escape through a window as townsfolk enter the room.","participants":["halana","alena","elders-of-gatstaf"],"location":"gatstaf","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":539,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":74,"quote":"Hal and Alena climbed down into the alley without any of the townsfolk being the wiser.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Hal%20and%20Alena%20climbed,townsfolk%20being%20the%20wiser.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Hal%20and%20Alena%20climbed,townsfolk%20being%20the%20wiser.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e7","era":null,"summary":"Armed with silver, they track Cathar Palter's trail, finding boot prints that become paw prints and a split trail at a crossroads.","particip