rds.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=the%20same%20that%20had,the%20ward%2Dmaker%2C%20Lady%20Evelin","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e9","era":null,"summary":"They realize the lace belongs to Elder Somlon and that the lycanthrope may be Mrs. Palter.","participants":["halana","alena","elder-somlon","mrs-palter"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":539,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":105,"quote":"Then what of Mrs. Palter?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Then%20what%20of%20Mrs.%20Palter%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Silver Moon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2016-03-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=Then%20what%20of%20Mrs.%20Palter%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Silver Moon\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"under-silver-moon-2016-03-02-e10","era":null,"summary":"Halana and Alena find Mrs. Palter chanting Ormendahl over her husband on a makeshift altar and tackle her.","participants":["halana","alena","mrs-palter","cathar-palter","ormendahl"],"location":"ulvenwald","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02","order":539,"story_date":"2016-03-02","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":122,"quote":"This woman was in contract with a horror.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-silver-moon-2016-03-02#:~:text=This%20woman%20was%20in%20contract%20with%20a%20horror.","citation":